    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "01. Core Concepts",
    "ruleNumber": "01.07",
    "summary": "For a **Battle-shock roll**, the unit's controller takes a [Leadership roll](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls). Failure makes the unit and every model in it **Battle-shocked**. While in that state, each model's [Objective Control](vsdata:core-rule/profiles) becomes '-'. The controller's [Stratagems](vsdata:core-rule/stratagems) cannot target the unit. The unit cannot begin an **[Action](vsdata:core-rule/actions)** or finish one under way.",
